# Response headers for the Cloudflare deployment (frontend/wrangler.jsonc).
# Cloudflare reads this file at deploy time and does not serve it.
#
# These lived in frontend/vercel.json until 24 August 2026 and left with it
# (docs/HANDOVER.md, "The deployment is gone, on purpose").
#
# Content-Security-Policy is NOT here yet, deliberately. The old one allow-listed
# the API origin in connect-src, and there is no API origin until the backend is
# deployed. A CSP naming the wrong one blocks every request without an error
# anyone sees. Add it back with the real origin; the previous value is
# `git show 6f1cd68^:frontend/vercel.json`.

# Vite fingerprints everything under /assets/, so a file there never changes
# under the same name.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  # camera is for /explore's AR view (ARCameraView.jsx); nothing uses the others.
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self), microphone=(), geolocation=()
